    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHA05DCD33F4B67971CD4A61D3CB7F5612" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>$85,490,000 was reported as Common Stock in the Company's Q2 2025 FERC Form No. 3Q and should have been reported as Capital Contributions from Members.&#160;</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
